            <td style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;"><b>Scenario:</b> Our Weather Report</td>
            <td style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;"><b>Theme:</b> Today's Weather Will Be Sunny with Some Rain Later.</td>
        </tr>
